; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hook.c	   416  
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hook.c	   417    /* A logical OR instead of a bitwise OR would be more meaningful here.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hook.c	   418     * But some compilers would complain about known decision outcome.
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Hook.c	   419     * Moving the calls directly into the decision would solve this, but MISRA will complain about possible sideeffects
